<!--
  Themed-icon layer (Android 13+).

  Android replaces the whole icon with this silhouette and tints it from the
  wallpaper palette, which is what makes a PatchIt icon match whatever theme the
  device is running. Same geometry as the foreground so the two never drift.
-->
